hmsu←fromTime micros;raw;hour;min;sec;u
⍝ Convert duckdb_time micros -> (hour min sec micros)
⍝ Uses raw packed u64 return from duckdb_from_time.

raw←api.duckdb_from_time micros
hour←(2*8)|raw
min←(2*8)|⌊raw÷(2*8)
sec←(2*8)|⌊raw÷(2*16)
u←(2*32)|⌊raw÷(2*32)
u←u-(u>((2*31)-1))×(2*32)
hmsu←hour min sec u

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
